  "content": "[vc_row][vc_column][eikra-vc-text-title style=\"style2\" title=\"Research Initiative\"][/eikra-vc-text-title][vc_column_text]\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Department of Mechanical Engineering</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Research &amp; Development&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Research Lab:</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The Department is recognized as Research Centre by VTU during 2015-16. The Faculties of the Department are actively involved in research and consultancy works in the areas of Composite Materials, Fracture Mechanics, Fuels &amp; Lubricants, Energy Systems Engineering and Renewable Energy.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>The Research Laboratory has the following facilities:</strong></span></p>\n\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n \t<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Basic Material Testing facilities like UTM, Fatigue testing machine, impact testing machine, wear testing machine etc are equipped to inspect the material properties for research activities.</span></li>\n \t<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Analysis software’s like CATIA, SOLID EDGE and ANSYS are used to carry out design &amp; analysis.</span></li>\n \t<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Reputed Journal access like SCI, Thomson router indexed to the Research Scholars.&nbsp;</span></li>\n \t<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Sufficient research related books and Internet facility.</span></li>\n \t<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Online Course material and videos of NPTEL are available which are useful for Stage-1 of research which constitutes course work examination.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #000000;\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p s